{"title":"Nightmares — A Halloween Party With Something to Talk About","startsAt":"2026-10-29T18:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-29T22:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**Haven’t been to a Halloween party in years?**\nMaybe it’s time.\n\n**A Halloween party with something to talk about.**\n\n*It’s in the Cards: Nightmares* is a Halloween social for people in their 30s, 40s & beyond, inside Moonlight Lounge (with secret alleyway access!).\n\nComing alone works well here. Everyone receives an outlandish nightmare scenario, then meets other guests while comparing and trading cards. Form a team of four for the rankings reveal and a chance to win prizes.\n\nIt's easy to start talking; the cards give you an easy reason to start a conversation.\n\nThis is a social event, not a dating or networking event. Costumes are encouraged, but optional.\n\n**Tickets:** $25 Regular · $35 Final Week\nAppetizers included. Refunds available until seven days before the event.\n\n**October 29 · 6:30–10:00 PM**\n**Moonlight Lounge · Toronto**","venue":{"name":"319 Augusta Avenue","address":"319 Augusta Ave, Toronto, ON M5T 1N9, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.656917,"lng":-79.402666,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":{"amount":25,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Head Out Toronto: Social Events for 30s & 40s","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/4/2/0/highres_536390208.jpeg"}